            "Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor's country (for example Cloudflare's CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.": [
                "Paa: gbogbo olub\u1eb9wo gb\u1ecdd\u1ecd k\u1ecdk\u1ecd gba (ofin to muna jul\u1ecd, ati ti aiyipada). Tan: nigba ti agbalejo tabi CDN r\u1eb9 ba royin oril\u1eb9-ede olub\u1eb9wo nikan (fun ap\u1eb9\u1eb9r\u1eb9 ak\u1ecdsori CF-IPCountry ti Cloudflare) ti o si wa ni ita EU, EEA, UK ati Switzerland. W\u1ecdn si n \u1e63e afihan asia naa, oril\u1eb9-ede ti a ko m\u1ecd ni a si \u1e63e it\u1ecdju r\u1eb9 bi \u1eb9ni pe o wa ninu EU."
